    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are analyzing student reviews of online courses.\n\nAnalyze the following review:\n\n{{ $json.review_content }}\n\nIdentify the main reason for the student's dissatisfaction.\n\nClassify it into exactly one category:\n- course_content\n- difficulty\n- instructor\n- assignments\n- platform\n- other\n\nAlso provide a short description of the problem.\n\nDo not infer information that is not present in the review.",
